      "message": "There\u0027s already a pretty significant implementation of this specification in the repo already (currently labeled nvidia as it didn\u0027t support AMD).  Rather than re-writing all the transports, could you please look at reusing the existing transports.  If we truly need a new app, I\u0027m open to it, but we shouldn\u0027t have two different pieces of code implementing the same specification.",
